<h1 class="visually-hidden">Sulistiono</h1>

<div class="home-terminal">
  <p><span class="prompt-char">$</span> <span class="cmd">whoami</span></p>
  <p class="output">Sulistiono-blog</p>

  <p><span class="prompt-char">$</span> <span class="cmd">cat</span> about.md</p>
  <p class="output output--meta"><span class="file-meta"># last modified: 2026-07-09</span></p>
  <p class="output">Web design, front-end performance, and terminal-inspired UI.<br>
  Practical tutorials, field notes, and build logs from someone<br>
  who spends way too much time obsessing over CSS variables<br>
  and static site architecture. No frameworks, no fluff.</p>

  <p><span class="prompt-char">$</span> <span class="cmd">tree</span> links/</p>
  <div class="tree-listing">
    <span class="tree-dir">links/</span>
    <span class="tree-line"><span class="tree-prefix">├──</span><a href="/about/">about/</a> <span class="entry-count">whoami</span></span>
    <span class="tree-line"><span class="tree-prefix">├──</span><a href="/posts/">posts/</a> <span class="entry-count">{{ collections.posts | length }} entries</span></span>
    <span class="tree-line tree-line--ext"><span class="tree-prefix">├──</span><a href="https://github.com/tionosulis">github</a></span>
    <span class="tree-line tree-line--ext"><span class="tree-prefix">├──</span><a href="https://x.com/tionosulis_">x.com</a></span>
    <span class="tree-line tree-line--ext"><span class="tree-prefix">└──</span><a href="mailto:contact.sulistiono@gmail.com">email</a></span>
  </div>

  <p><span class="prompt-char">$</span> <span class="cmd">ls -lt posts/ | head -3</span></p>
  <div class="tree-listing">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
    <span class="tree-line tree-line--recent"><span class="tree-line--meta"><span class="tree-prefix">{% if loop.last %}└── {% else %}├── {% endif %}</span><span class="recent-date">{{ post.date | getDate("yyyy-MM-dd") }}</span></span><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}{% if post.data.pinned %} ★{% endif %}</a></span>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="cursor-line"><span class="prompt-char">$</span> <span class="blinking-cursor">&#9610;</span></p>
</div>
